[
  {
    "content_id": "10056001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56001001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;我保罗做上帝的奴仆和耶稣基督的使徒，是为了使上帝拣选的人有信心并明白真理，从而过敬虔的生活，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56001002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;有永生的盼望。这永生是从不说谎的上帝在亘古以前应许的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56001003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;祂在所定的时候，借着人的传扬将自己的道显明出来。我奉我们救主上帝的命令传扬这道。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56001004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;提多啊，我写信给你，就我们共同的信仰来说，你是我真正的儿子。 愿父上帝和我们的救主基督耶稣赐给你恩典和平安！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56001005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;当初，我把你留在克里特岛，是要你完成未办完的事工，并照我的指示在各城选立长老。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56001006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;做长老的必须无可指责，只有一位妻子，儿女都信主、没有放荡不羁的行为。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56001007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;身为上帝的管家，做监督的必须无可指责，不傲慢，不暴躁，不酗酒，不好斗，不贪财。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56001008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;他必须好客、乐善、自制、正直、圣洁、自律，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56001009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;持守所领受的真道，以便能够以纯正的教导劝勉人，驳倒那些反对的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56001010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;因为有许多悖逆之人喜欢空谈，善于欺骗，尤其是那些奉行割礼的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56001011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;你一定要堵住他们的口，因为他们为了不义之财教不该教的，毁坏别人全家。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56001012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;克里特人自己的一位先知说：“克里特人说谎成性，邪恶如兽，好吃懒做。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 1:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56001013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;这话是真的。因此你要严正地斥责他们，使他们有纯正的信仰，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056001014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 1:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56001014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;不理会犹太人的无稽之谈和那些违背真理之人的诫律。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056001015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 1:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56001015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;对洁净的人而言，一切都是洁净的；对污秽不信的人而言，什么都不洁净，连他们的思想和良心都是污秽的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056001016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 1:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56001016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;他们自称认识上帝，在行为上却否认祂。他们令人可憎，悖逆成性，一无是处。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056002001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 2:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56002001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;你的教导要符合纯正的教义。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056002002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 2:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56002002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;劝年长的男子要节制、庄重、自律，有全备的信心、爱心和耐心。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056002003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 2:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56002003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;劝年长的妇女要过敬虔的生活，不说长道短，不做酒的奴隶，要以身作则。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056002004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 2:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56002004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;这样，她们就能教导年轻的妇女爱丈夫、爱儿女、</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056002005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 2:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56002005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;自制、贞洁、持家、和善、顺服丈夫，免得上帝的道被人毁谤。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056002006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 2:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56002006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;劝勉年轻的男子要自制。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056002007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 2:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56002007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;你自己要在各样善行上做众人的榜样，在教导上要诚恳、认真、</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056002008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 2:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56002008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;言语纯全、无可指责，让那些反对的人无话可说、自觉羞愧。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056002009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 2:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56002009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;劝勉做奴仆的要凡事顺服主人，让主人满意，不顶撞主人，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056002010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 2:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56002010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;不偷拿主人的东西，为人要忠信可靠，好凡事尊崇我们救主上帝的教导。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056002011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 2:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56002011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;因为上帝拯救世人的恩典已经显明了，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056002012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 2:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56002012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;这恩典教导我们除掉不敬虔的心和世俗的私欲，在今世过自律、公义、敬畏上帝的生活，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056002013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 2:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56002013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;怀着美好的盼望等候我们伟大的上帝和救主耶稣基督的荣耀显现。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056002014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 2:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56002014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;主耶稣为我们牺牲自己，要救赎我们脱离一切罪恶，并洁净我们，使我们做祂热心行善的子民。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056002015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 2:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56002015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;你要讲明这些事，充分运用权柄来劝勉人、责备人，别让人轻看你。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056003001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 3:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56003001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;你要提醒众人顺服执政掌权者，要服从，随时准备做各种善事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056003002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 3:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56003002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;不要毁谤，不要争吵，要谦和、恭敬地对待每一个人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056003003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 3:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56003003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;从前我们也愚蠢、悖逆、易受迷惑，受各种私欲和享乐驱使，心里充满恶念和嫉妒，令人憎恶，也彼此憎恨。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056003004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 3:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56003004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;但我们的救主上帝向人彰显了祂的恩慈和仁爱，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056003005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 3:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56003005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;借着重生之洗和圣灵的更新拯救了我们，这并非因为我们有义行，而是因为祂的怜悯。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056003006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 3:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56003006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;上帝借着我们的救主耶稣基督把圣灵丰丰富富地浇灌在我们身上。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056003007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 3:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56003007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;这样，我们既然靠着祂的恩典被称为义人，就可以成为后嗣，有永生的盼望。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056003008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 3:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56003008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;以上这些话是可信的，希望你认真强调，使信上帝的人专心行善。这都是造福众人的美事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056003009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 3:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56003009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;要避免愚昧的争论、有关家谱的辩驳和律法上的争执，因为这些毫无益处。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056003010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 3:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56003010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;对于制造分裂的人，警告过一两次后，要和他断绝来往。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056003011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 3:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56003011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;因为你知道这种人已经背道犯罪，自定己罪。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056003012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 3:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56003012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;我会派亚提马或者推基古去见你。到时候，你要尽快到尼哥波立来见我，因为我决定在那里过冬。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056003013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 3:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56003013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;你要为西纳律师和亚波罗送行，尽力帮助他们，让他们路上一无所缺。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056003014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 3:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56003014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;我们的弟兄姊妹也要学习行善，供应有急需的人，免得毫无建树。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056003015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 3:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56003015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;这里的弟兄姊妹都问候你，也请你问候那些因信仰而爱我们的人。 愿恩典常与你们众人同在！</p>"
  }
]